# ppa:drphilth/honor-fmbp — HONOR MagicBook Pro 14 (FMB-P) Ubuntu enablement.
# Installed by honor-fmbp-archive-keyring. "Adds the PPA" purely by dropping
# this file plus the signing key in /usr/share/keyrings — no network, so it can
# be applied from the installer chroot offline. The repo is only contacted later,
# on `apt update` / `apt upgrade`, once the machine is booted with networking.
#
# Pinned to the 26.04 (resolute) series — the only release these packages target.
Types: deb
URIs: https://ppa.launchpadcontent.net/drphilth/honor-fmbp/ubuntu/
Suites: resolute
Components: main
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/honor-fmbp-ppa.gpg
